<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data indicates profit around 11 bln dmk.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data indicates profit around 11 bln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank is likely to report a 1996 profit of about 11 billion marks ($6.7 billion), according to data released on Thursday in the central bank's end-of-year balance sheet.</p>
<p>The data showed the central bank's &quot;other liabilities&quot; at 11.048 billion marks. This position in the balance sheet gives a rough indication of the central bank's profit, details of which will not be announced for several weeks.</p>
</text>
